<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 7.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 7.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 March 7		March 6</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.290		  5.136</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   8.333		 11.858</p>
<p>Cash balance		  13.623		 16.994</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,  subject to limit	5,265.656</p>
<p>	    5,270.822</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5.329 billion were issued and $54 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
